Using the commands from cr.bat produces a packed executable.

It just uses the lzma pack for 7-zip (downloadable from the 7-zip site),
the 7-zip package itself is not necessary, though it might be useful.

It could be adapted for powershell.

Note that the working directory should be "build", to get the correct paths in the archive (though there may be 7-zip command line switches to adapt).

